WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.100
A reaction game is a few ideas you know, working together.

2
00:00:05.076 --> 00:00:08.801
A random wait, then the heart, and start stores the time.

3
00:00:09.827 --> 00:00:14.077
At the press, running time minus start is your reaction time.

4
00:00:16.771 --> 00:00:21.196
waiting catches early presses, and best keeps your fastest time.
